# Blasted Lands - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 5 confirmed flagged rares of the Blasted
# Lands and its fixed Solid Chests. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper
# is the rare. Two rares above the 40-50 band ship with honest come-back
# notes (sole signatures argue for them); four above-band rares without
# signatures, and one in-band rare whose only significance is a core quest
# item, are excluded with reasons - see
# docs/blasted-lands-companions-inventory.md. One rare is a single confirmed
# point, so that step is a plain single-goto step (a loop needs at least
# two). No tame lines ship (the data has no tameability flag and the core
# guide carries no tame corroboration - see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere,
# so none are stated. No shipped rare is a giver, ender, or objective of
# any core-contracted quest; where a shipped rare also drops a core quest
# item the note says so and points at the core guide.
guide butler-routes-completionist/blasted-lands-rares
title Blasted Lands - Rares & Treasures
levels 40-50
zone Blasted Lands
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords blasted lands, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Mojo the Twisted — the north-west

  zone map 1419

  loop
  goto 41.74,11.80
  goto 42.06,14.93
  goto 45.18,16.02
  goto 45.33,16.45
  kill 8296 optional
  collect 282014 "Twisted Shadow Staff" optional
  note Level 48 rare working its 4 confirmed points in the north-west; its sole drop is the Twisted Shadow Staff. It also drops the Flawless Draenethyst Sphere, which the core guide's Kum'isha chain already routes - this guide only points at the rare.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Deatheye — the west

  zone map 1419

  loop
  goto 43.48,27.89
  goto 44.04,25.01
  goto 44.46,26.36
  goto 44.53,30.21
  goto 45.02,19.59
  goto 45.15,25.14
  goto 45.17,28.15
  goto 45.19,18.27
  goto 45.96,17.80
  goto 45.99,20.36
  goto 47.03,22.07
  goto 48.46,20.34
  goto 50.17,20.72
  kill 8302 optional
  collect 282020 "Stonegaze Wand" optional
  note Level 49 rare working its 13 confirmed points in the west; its sole drop is the Stonegaze Wand. It also drops Basilisk Brain, which the core guide's Lynnore chain already routes - this guide only points at the rare.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Fingat — the east

  zone map 1419

  goto 71.40,15.00
  kill 14446 optional
  note Level 43 rare at its single confirmed point in the east; the data shows no sole drop for it and it drops no quest item, so there is nothing to collect. No quest takes it.
  note Drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Solid Chests — the east and center

  zone map 1419

  loop
  goto 71.30,13.30
  goto 72.80,13.80
  goto 73.80,14.80
  goto 42.50,14.33
  goto 44.38,12.01
  goto 62.41,34.26
  goto 65.46,33.37
  goto 66.83,29.61
  interact 4149 optional
  interact 153451 optional
  note Two generic Solid Chest objects share the zone, 4149 at three points in the far east and 153451 at five points in the north-west and center; loot is the usual chest fare. No quest takes either.
  note Respawn timers unconfirmed.

step Akubar the Seer — the center-south (come back later)

  zone map 1419

  loop
  goto 45.08,48.14
  goto 46.02,48.04
  goto 51.31,53.12
  goto 52.01,51.85
  goto 58.35,46.03
  goto 59.04,43.56
  goto 60.66,43.76
  goto 60.92,45.23
  kill 8298 optional
  collect 282019 "Braided Seer Stones" optional
  note Level 54 rare working its 8 confirmed points in the center-south; its sole drop is the Braided Seer Stones. No quest takes it. Come back at high level - four over the guide band.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Magronos the Unyielding — the center-south (come back later)

  zone map 1419

  goto 47.20,47.14
  kill 8297 optional
  collect 282026 "Unyielding Battle Signet" optional
  note Level 56 rare at its single confirmed point in the center-south; its sole drop is the Unyielding Battle Signet. It also drops draenethyst spheres and fragments, which the core guide's Kum'isha chain already routes - this guide only points at the rare. Come back at high level - six over the guide band.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.
